"Maranor was a warband leader in her mortal life, and fought with a short spear."
"Maranor's true form is a fit woman, her wild hair tied with bones and twine."
"Maranor spent a century scheming to take Emeric's crown."
"Maranor needed to prove Emeric unfit before she could challenge him."
"Maranor allied with Khaton, promising to unseal him."
"Maranor meant to unite mankind under Oleander, then claim the empty throne of the gods."
"The other light gods refused Maranor's plan; Neriad refused first."
"Maranor pulled Viviane into the in-between in her sleep; her summons cannot be refused."
"Maranor once offered to back Viviane as a guardian of order if her temples were spared."
"Maranor tried to devour dead Khaton's might and was tainted by it."
"At Mornyr Maranor cut off her own corrupted arm with the Slayer."
"Maradoc pushed Maranor through a portal to Earth, and none knows if she lives."
